{"id":262,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Mightyena travel and act as a pack in the wild. The memory of its life in the wild compels the Pokémon to obey only those Trainers that it recognizes to possess superior skill."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Mightyena gives obvious signals when it is preparing to attack. It starts to growl deeply and then flattens its body. This Pokémon will bite savagely with its sharply pointed fangs."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It chases down prey in a pack of around ten. They defeat foes with perfectly coordinated teamwork."},{"games":["X","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It will always obey the commands of a skilled Trainer. Its behavior arises from its living in packs in ancient times."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It chases down prey in a pack. It will never disobey the commands of a skilled Trainer."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"In the wild, MIGHTYENA live in a pack. They never defy their leader’s orders. They defeat foes with perfectly coordinated teamwork."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Intimidate","hidden":false,"description":"When the Pokémon enters a battle, it intimidates opposing Pokémon and makes them cower, lowering their Attack stats."},{"name":"Quick Feet","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Speed stat if the Pokémon has a status condition."},{"name":"Moxie","hidden":true,"description":"When the Pokémon knocks out a target, it shows moxie, which boosts its Attack stat."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"grassland","color":"Gray","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":261,"name":"Poochyena","condition":null,"children":[{"id":262,"name":"Mightyena","condition":"Lv. 18","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,555],[1,28],[1,33],[1,44],[1,168],[1,242],[1,422],[1,423],[1,424],[13,43],[13,336],[16,46],[20,207],[24,372],[28,